// rts/data/scripts/ui_research.json: the player-interface research script (rts/docs/specs/player_interface_2.md section 4, check 1). Parsed by Rts.Sim.Data.CommandScript in the Unity SimulationHost (Script Relative Path scripts/ui_research.json) and the headless harness (--script rts/data/scripts/ui_research.json). ui_sandbox.json plus a complete Storm Spire beside the Great Aerie and two Fledglings gathering Rare at the flank field, so Stormcaller Plans (25 Common, 125 Rare) becomes affordable with no player input. Slot 0 is Skai (local player), slot 1 is Water.
